---
import GlobalLayout from "../layouts/GlobalLayout.astro";
---

<GlobalLayout>
  <nav class="mx-auto max-w-3xl mt-40">
    <div class="flex justify-between text-2xl text-emerald-700">
      <h1 class="font-semibold">Matthew Arthur</h1>
      <ul class="flex gap-2">
        <li>
          <a target="_blank" href="https://www.github.com/arthurmatthew"
            ><i class="bi bi-github"></i></a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            target="_blank"
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/matthew-arthur-6889ba395/"
            ><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i></a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl mt-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-xl">
      <p>I'm a passionate web developer from Seattle.</p>
      <p>
        I develop full-stack, user-facing experiences with a focus on the
        intersection of design and functionality. I've created impactful
        applications that target my favorite communities and interests.
      </p>
      <p>
        In my free time, I continue to design with sound and emotion. I
        digitally compose music, tweak synths, engineer artists, and master
        rough mixes. Of course, I play a few instruments and write songs without
        my computer, too.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mt-10 mx-auto">
    <h1 class="font-semibold text-emerald-700 text-2xl">Business</h1>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-xl mt-10">
      <p>
        I'm working on starting a web design agency called <a
          class="underline"
          href="https://sunsethillwebdesign.com"
          target="_blank">Sunset Hill Web Design</a
        >. I want to assist small business around my community and provide
        local, curated development outside of the large agencies that pretend to
        be local. I hope to begin working with clients soon.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl mt-10">
    <h1 class="font-semibold text-emerald-700 text-2xl">Projects</h1>
    <div
      class="mt-10 grid gap-2 grid-rows-2 md:grid-rows-1 md:grid-cols-2 text-xl"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <a
          target="_blank"
          class="font-semibold text-purple-900"
          href="https://useclicktrack.com"
          ><span class="underline">Clicktrack</span>
          <i class="bi bi-link"></i></a
        >
        <p>
          Clicktrack is an advanced metronome app that I designed for musicians
          like band directors or drummers who deal with dynamic tempo.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <a
          target="_blank"
          class="font-semibold text-red-900"
          href="https://bhsradio.com"
          ><span class="underline">KBHS</span>
          <i class="bi bi-link"></i></a
        >
        <p>
          KBHS is a radio station I built for my high school. It runs on a
          DigitalOcean VPS hosting internet radio software capable of
          pre-recorded playback and livestreaming.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mt-10 mx-auto">
    <h1 class="font-semibold text-emerald-700 text-2xl">Skills</h1>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-xl mt-10">
      <p>
        My main tools are <b>TypeScript</b>, <b>React</b>, and <b>Tailwind</b>.
        I use frameworks like <b>Vike</b> or <b>Next.js</b> to render and distribute
        my frontends. I combine various authentication and storage providers like
        <b>AWS</b> or
        <b>Google Cloud</b> to create functional and secure backends.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm able to apply my general networking experience to understand common
        patterns, allowing me to create powerful services even if I'm not
        familiar with a specific technology. My strong web design foundations
        help me learn frameworks quickly, allowing me to explore beyond React.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've always been interested in trying many technologies, despite
        settling into web design. In the past, I built personal experience with <b
          >Python</b
        >, <b>VB.NET</b>, and <b>C#</b>. Outside of building functional
        applications, I'm learning low-level programming principles.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <footer class="flex justify-center my-20">
    <p class="opacity-50">Updated 11/19/2025</p>
  </footer>
</GlobalLayout>
